                              <div class="a-popover-preload" id="a-popover-pqvOverlay">             <div data-cel-widget="pqv-dpx-widget-desktop" data-csa-c-content-id="pqv-dpx-widget-desktop" data-csa-c-slot-id="pqv-dpx-widget-desktop" data-csa-c-type="popup" class="a-section a-padding-none celwidget">      <script type="text/javascript">(function(f) {var _np=(window.P._namespace("DetailPagePQVAssets"));if(_np.guardFatal){_np.guardFatal(f)(_np);}else{f(_np);}}(function(P) {
                P.now('pqv').execute(function(pqv) {
                    if (!pqv) {
                        P.register("pqv", function () {
                            return {
                                overlayType: 'desktop'
                            };
                        });
                    }
                });
            }));</script>         <h1 id="pqv-title"> Product Summary: Uei Test Instruments Anemometer with Humidity, 99 to 3937 FPM DAFM3B - 1 Each </h1>    <p id="pqv-byline">From UEi Test Instruments</p>               <div class="a-section a-spacing-medium">  <p id="pqv-ratings" data-target="#averageCustomerReviews_feature_div" class="a-spacing-none">  3.8 out of 5 stars, 17 ratings </p> <span class="a-declarative" data-action="pqv-reviews-action" data-pqv-reviews-action="{}"> <a id="pqv-reviews" data-target="#customer-reviews_feature_div" class="a-link-normal" href="?ref=dp_product_quick_view#customer-reviews_feature_div"> Customer reviews </a> </span>   </div>        <div class="a-section a-spacing-medium"> <h2 id="pqv-price"> Price </h2>   <p class="a-text-bold"> No featured offers available </p>                <p class="a-text-italic"> <span class="a-declarative" data-action="pqv-buying-options-action" data-pqv-buying-options-action="{}"> <a id="pqv-buying-options" data-target="#dynamic-aod-ingress-box" class="a-link-normal" href="?ref=dp_product_quick_view#dynamic-aod-ingress-box"> Other sellers </a> </span> </p> <p class="a-text-italic"> <span class="a-declarative" data-action="pqv-unqualified-buybox-action" data-pqv-unqualified-buybox-action="{}"> <a id="pqv-unqualified-buybox" data-target="#unqualifiedBuyBox" class="a-link-normal" href="?ref=dp_product_quick_view#unqualifiedBuyBox"> Other sellers </a> </span> </p>  </div>         <div id="pqv-feature-bullets" data-target="#featurebullets_feature_div" class="a-section a-spacing-medium"> <h2 id="pqv-feature-bullets-heading">About this Item</h2> <ul class="a-unordered-list a-vertical">  <li><span class="a-list-item">Made in China</span></li>  </ul> </div>           <div id="pqv-description" data-target="#productDescription_feature_div" class="a-section a-spacing-medium">  <h2 id="pqv-description-heading">Product Description</h2>    <div>
                    The DAFM3B Anemometer/ Psychrometer meter is designed with 6 HVAC/R must have parameters in one instrument. These are included in a portable battery operated instrument for measuring humidity, air temperature, dew point and calculating wet bulb, air velocity and air volume. The sensor is built into the remote fan and is specially protected by a twist cap. While in operation, open the cap for accurate temperature and humidity readings. From the Manufacturer: UEi Test Instruments has over 50 years’ experience designing and manufacturing a broad range of award-winning, industry-leading Test and Measurement Tools. Professionals recognize the UEi brand for quality and innovative features designed to solve real-world problems. UEi backs its products with dedicated technical support, service and repair teams.  </div>
               </div>                        <div class="a-section a-spacing-medium"> <h2 id="pqv-options-available">Options Available</h2>    <h3>Style</h3> <ul class="a-unordered-list a-vertical">  <li><span class="a-list-item"> DAFM3B </span></li>  </ul>  <span class="a-declarative" data-action="pqv-twister-action" data-pqv-twister-action="{}"> <a id="pqv-twister" data-target="#twister-plus-inline-twister,#twister" class="a-link-normal" href="?ref=dp_product_quick_view#twister"> Browse all available options </a> </span> </div>              <div id="pqv-important-information" data-target="#importantInformation_feature_div" class="a-section a-spacing-medium"> <h2 id="pqv-important-information-heading">Important Information</h2>     <h3>Proposition 65 Warning for California Consumers</h3>   <p>WARNING:  Cancer -  <a class="a-link-normal" href="https://www.P65Warnings.ca.gov?ref=dp_product_quick_view">www.P65Warnings.ca.gov </a></p>    </div>                  <div class="a-section a-spacing-medium"> <span class="a-declarative" data-action="pqv-report-issue-action" data-pqv-report-issue-action="{}"> <a id="pqv-report-issue" data-target="#tellAmazon_feature_div" class="a-link-normal" href="?ref=dp_product_quick_view#tellAmazon_feature_div"> Report an issue with this product or seller </a> </span> </div>                     <div id="pqv-feedback" class="a-section a-spacing-medium"> <h2 id="pqv-feedback-heading">Feedback</h2> <p>Did you find this product summary feature useful?</p>   <div id="pqv-feedback-buttons-section" class="a-section"> <div class="a-section a-padding-base aok-float-left"> <span class="a-declarative" data-action="pqv-feedback-positive-action" data-pqv-feedback-positive-action="{}"> <span id="pqv-feedback-positive" class="a-button a-button-base"><span class="a-button-inner"><input id="pqv-feedback-positive-native" aria-described-by="Submit feedback that this product summary is useful" class="a-button-input" type="submit" aria-labelledby="pqv-feedback-